  "description": "Princess Eunmyeong meets the scholar Seoyul, to whom she falls in love and gives herself to without any hesitation. So in order to get his attention, she went to Boryeong to see him on the pretext of taking blood. For some reason, Seoyul only pushes her away and she gets frustrated with him. But she didn't give up and expressed her feelings towards him. \n\n*\"When no one believed in me, you were the only one who stood up for me.\"\n\"Become my benefactor.\"\n\"I will guarantee you wealth and glory.\"* \n\nPrincess Eunmyeong, the most beautiful girl in Joseon. Will she be able to win the heart of the most intelligent man in Joseon?",
